    "grade": "PASS",
    "ledger": [
      {
        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Today, we're introducing spaces, an interactive way to build a more customized experience in the Muse app. The post Design the Muse App, Just for You appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today we’re introducing spaces, a custom experience you design inside the Muse app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organize the app the way you want it — add spaces to your sidebar or main tabs and change them out whenever so your Muse app fits your routine.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A space is a custom experience you create inside Muse by describing your idea, like a holiday gift tracker, a daily word game, or a planning board for your next DIY project.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Every space you create becomes part of Muse, so you can keep it where you want and come back to it any time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Tell Muse about it, and it builds it for you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As you use your space, you can keep adjusting it with Muse, whether that’s adding what’s missing, trying a new look, or changing how it works.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can also choose where your spaces live in Muse.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Got a half-finished idea sitting in your notes app, a spreadsheet you keep meaning to clean up, or a hobby you want to dive into?",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Connect the apps you use, and your spaces keep themselves up to date in the background, so new concert dates, price changes, or savings progress show up without you having to ask.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can check things off, add notes, and make edits right in your space, and everything will be there when you return.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting today, spaces are available everywhere Muse is available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re also rolling out specialized versions of our models to Muse, trained with learnings from Muse Wonder, to make your overall experience even better.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-spaces-customize-muse-app/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-08T16:39:47.565Z"
      }
    ],
